{"page":32,"width":1976,"height":2547,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 I 데이터 모델링의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":197,"y":106,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"I","x":291,"y":108,"width":13,"height":31},{"text":"데이터","x":331,"y":107,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"모델링의","x":444,"y":108,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"이해","x":581,"y":107,"width":57,"height":31}]},{"text":"마. 의사소통","words":[{"text":"마.","x":196,"y":263,"width":44,"height":35},{"text":"의사소통","x":261,"y":264,"width":134,"height":36}]},{"text":"데이터 모텔의 역할은 많다. 그 중에서도 중요한 것이 데이터 모델의 의사소통(Commumcation)의 역할이다.","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":240,"y":343,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"모텔의","x":351,"y":343,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"역할은","x":463,"y":342,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"많다.","x":570,"y":340,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":654,"y":346,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"중에서도","x":698,"y":342,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"중요한","x":833,"y":341,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":940,"y":340,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":1014,"y":340,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"모델의","x":1116,"y":340,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"의사소통(Commumcation)의","x":1221,"y":338,"width":421,"height":38},{"text":"역할이다.","x":1660,"y":339,"width":134,"height":35}]},{"text":"데이터 모텔은 대상으로 하는 업무를 데이터 관점에서 분석하고 이를 설계하여 나오는 최종 산출물이다. 데이터를","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":197,"y":397,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"모텔은","x":308,"y":397,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"대상으로","x":420,"y":397,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"하는","x":558,"y":396,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"업무를","x":634,"y":397,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":738,"y":397,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"관점에서","x":840,"y":396,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"분석하고","x":974,"y":396,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"이를","x":1109,"y":396,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"설계하여","x":1182,"y":395,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"나오는","x":1315,"y":394,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"최종","x":1417,"y":393,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"산출물이다.","x":1490,"y":392,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":1669,"y":393,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"분석 과정에서는 자연스럽게 많은 업무 규칙들이 도출된다. 이 과정에서 도출되는 많은 업무 규칙들은 데이터 모델에","words":[{"text":"분석","x":195,"y":454,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"과정에서는","x":272,"y":452,"width":160,"height":36},{"text":"자연스럽게","x":444,"y":451,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":610,"y":452,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"업무","x":682,"y":453,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"규칙들이","x":752,"y":452,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"도출된다.","x":883,"y":453,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":1024,"y":452,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"과정에서","x":1064,"y":452,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"도출되는","x":1194,"y":452,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":1324,"y":450,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"업무","x":1396,"y":449,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"규칙들은","x":1466,"y":449,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":1599,"y":449,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"모델에","x":1703,"y":448,"width":89,"height":35}]},{"text":"언터티, 서브타입, 속성, 관계 등의 형태로 최대한 자세하게 표현되어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"언터티,","x":195,"y":509,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"서브타입,","x":326,"y":508,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"속성,","x":480,"y":507,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"관계","x":571,"y":507,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"등의","x":648,"y":508,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"형태로","x":728,"y":507,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"최대한","x":834,"y":507,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"자세하게","x":944,"y":507,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"표현되어야","x":1080,"y":507,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1250,"y":507,"width":68,"height":35}]},{"text":"예를 들면 \u0027사원\u0027 테이블에는 어떠한 \u0027사원구분\u0027을 가지는 사원들이 존재하는지, \u0027정규직•임시직\u0027 사원들이 같이","words":[{"text":"예를","x":237,"y":565,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"들면","x":319,"y":563,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"\u0027사원\u0027","x":396,"y":563,"width":80,"height":35},{"text":"테이블에는","x":492,"y":563,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"어떠한","x":661,"y":563,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"\u0027사원구분\u0027을","x":765,"y":563,"width":170,"height":35},{"text":"가지는","x":949,"y":563,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"사원들이","x":1053,"y":563,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"존재하는지,","x":1191,"y":562,"width":160,"height":39},{"text":"\u0027정규직•임시직\u0027","x":1367,"y":561,"width":207,"height":36},{"text":"사원들이","x":1588,"y":560,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"같이","x":1729,"y":560,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"존재하는지, 아니면 또 다른 형태의 사원들OI 존재하는지를 표현해야 한다. 더 나아가서 \u0027호봉이라는 속성은 \u0027정규직\u0027","words":[{"text":"존재하는지,","x":194,"y":621,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"아니면","x":377,"y":620,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"또","x":483,"y":624,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":528,"y":620,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"형태의","x":602,"y":620,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"사원들OI","x":702,"y":619,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"존재하는지를","x":834,"y":620,"width":180,"height":35},{"text":"표현해야","x":1025,"y":619,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1158,"y":619,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1240,"y":619,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"나아가서","x":1282,"y":619,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"\u0027호봉이라는","x":1413,"y":618,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"속성은","x":1586,"y":618,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"\u0027정규직\u0027","x":1689,"y":617,"width":105,"height":35}]},{"text":"일 때에만 존재하는 속성인다. 이러한 업무 규칙이 데이터 모델에 표현되어야 한다. 또한 관리하는 사원들 중에서","words":[{"text":"일","x":196,"y":676,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"때에만","x":243,"y":676,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"존재하는","x":352,"y":675,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"속성인다.","x":493,"y":675,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":643,"y":676,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"업무","x":747,"y":676,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"규칙이","x":820,"y":676,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":926,"y":675,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"모델에","x":1029,"y":675,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"표현되어야","x":1136,"y":675,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1301,"y":675,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"또한","x":1384,"y":675,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"관리하는","x":1459,"y":675,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"사원들","x":1594,"y":674,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"중에서","x":1700,"y":673,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"\u0027정규직\u0027 A卜원들만이 \u0027급여\u0027 테이블과 관계를 가진다. 이러한 부분은 개별 관계로 데이터 모텔에 표현되어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"\u0027정규직\u0027","x":194,"y":731,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"A卜원들만이","x":324,"y":730,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"\u0027급여\u0027","x":496,"y":731,"width":78,"height":35},{"text":"테이블과","x":588,"y":731,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"관계를","x":724,"y":731,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"가진다.","x":832,"y":731,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":949,"y":731,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"부분은","x":1052,"y":732,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"개별","x":1160,"y":730,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"관계로","x":1234,"y":730,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":1341,"y":730,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"모텔에","x":1446,"y":731,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"표현되어야","x":1552,"y":730,"width":156,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1721,"y":730,"width":71,"height":34}]},{"text":"정보시스템을 은용관리하는 많은 관련자들이 설계자가 정의한 많은 업무 규칙들을 동일한 의미로 받아들이고","words":[{"text":"정보시스템을","x":240,"y":787,"width":190,"height":35},{"text":"은용관리하는","x":442,"y":787,"width":200,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":655,"y":787,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"관련자들이","x":729,"y":787,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"설계자가","x":898,"y":787,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"정의한","x":1036,"y":787,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":1140,"y":787,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"업무","x":1214,"y":786,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"규칙들을","x":1287,"y":785,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"동일한","x":1424,"y":786,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"의미로","x":1532,"y":787,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"받아들이고","x":1637,"y":786,"width":157,"height":35}]},{"text":"활용할 수 있게 하는 역할을 하게 된다. 즉 데이터 모델이 진정한 의사소통(Communication)의 도구로서의 역할을","words":[{"text":"활용할","x":194,"y":843,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":304,"y":844,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"있게","x":349,"y":843,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"하는","x":422,"y":843,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"역할을","x":499,"y":843,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"하게","x":602,"y":843,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"된다.","x":676,"y":844,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"즉","x":758,"y":846,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"데이터","x":803,"y":843,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"모델이","x":904,"y":843,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"진정한","x":1011,"y":843,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"의사소통(Communication)의","x":1112,"y":842,"width":410,"height":38},{"text":"도구로서의","x":1537,"y":843,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"역할을","x":1704,"y":842,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"하게 된다.","words":[{"text":"하게","x":195,"y":900,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":278,"y":899,"width":71,"height":35}]},{"text":"바. 통합성","words":[{"text":"바.","x":197,"y":1015,"width":42,"height":36},{"text":"통합성","x":258,"y":1013,"width":94,"height":38}]},{"text":"기업들이 과거부터 정보시스템을 구축해 왔던 방법은 개별 업무별로 단위 정보시스템을 구축하여 현재까지 유지","words":[{"text":"기업들이","x":239,"y":1096,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"과거부터","x":372,"y":1096,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"정보시스템을","x":509,"y":1096,"width":184,"height":35},{"text":"구축해","x":704,"y":1096,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"왔던","x":809,"y":1096,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"방법은","x":884,"y":1095,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"개별","x":988,"y":1095,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"업무별로","x":1062,"y":1096,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"단위","x":1197,"y":1096,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"정보시스템을","x":1271,"y":1094,"width":183,"height":37},{"text":"구축하여","x":1464,"y":1096,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"현재까지","x":1601,"y":1095,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"유지","x":1735,"y":1094,"width":57,"height":35}]},{"text":"보수를 해오고 있는 것이 보통이다. 점진적인 확장과 보완의 방법으로 정보시스템을 구축해 왔기 때문에 동일한","words":[{"text":"보수를","x":196,"y":1155,"width":95,"height":34},